UID:df2966c19e9eb97f@ai-model-deprecations
DTSTAMP:20261108T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:Google: 5 model changes
DESCRIPTION:gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025 (shutdown) -> gem
 ini-3.8-live. Google lists the earliest possible shutdown date.\ngemini-2.
 5-flash-preview-tts (shutdown) -> gemini-3.8-flash-tts or gemini-3.8-flash
 -lite-tts. Google lists the earliest possible shutdown date.\ngemini-2.5-p
 ro-preview-tts (shutdown) -> gemini-3.8-flash-tts or gemini-3.8-flash-lite
 -tts. Google lists the earliest possible shutdown date.\ngemini-3.1-flash-
 live-preview (shutdown) -> gemini-3.8-live. Google lists the earliest poss
 ible shutdown date.\ngemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview (shutdown) -> gemini-3.8
 -flash-tts or gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts. Google lists the earliest possibl
 e shutdown date.\nSources: https://aistudio.google.com/docs/deprecations
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:9dc37669b6523b7e@ai-model-deprecations
DTSTAMP:20261108T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:Anthropic: 2 model changes
DESCRIPTION:claude-opus-4-8 (feature) -> claude-opus-5-5. Fast mode removed
 : requests with speed "fast" return an error.\nclaude-sonnet-4-5-20250929 
 (shutdown) -> claude-sonnet-5-5. Retirement on the Claude API.\nSources: h
 ttps://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations https:/
 /platform.claude.com/docs/en/release-notes/overview
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:07c9b970e33e155b@ai-model-deprecations
DTSTAMP:20261108T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:OpenAI: 4 model changes
DESCRIPTION:Agent Builder (shutdown) -> Agents SDK or ChatGPT Workspace Age
 nts\nEvals dashboard and API (shutdown) -> Promptfoo\ngpt-5.6-sol (price).
  Promotional pricing ($4 input / $20 output per 1M tokens) ends\; the late
 r price is not published on the model page.\nv1/prompts (shutdown) -> Prom
 pt content in your own code. The v1/prompts API and reusable prompt object
 s shut down.\nSources: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
  https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.6-sol
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8a3908fc02bc8c32@ai-model-deprecations
DTSTAMP:20261108T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:Google: 3 model changes
DESCRIPTION:gemini-2.5-flash (reroute) -> gemini-3.5-flash-lite. Requests k
 eep working but are answered by and billed as gemini-3.5-flash-lite.\ngemi
 ni-2.5-pro (reroute) -> gemini-3.8-flash. Requests keep working but are an
 swered by and billed as gemini-3.8-flash.\ngemini-4-argon (price). $2 / $1
 0 per 1M input / output tokens becomes $4 / $20\; cached input $0.10 becom
 es $0.20.\nSources: https://aistudio.google.com/docs/deprecations https://
 aistudio.google.com/docs/pricing
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
