BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f324f71d7f8d0ce2@ai-model-deprecations
DTSTAMP:20261108T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:OpenAI: 6 model changes
DESCRIPTION:gpt-5 (shutdown) -> gpt-5.6-sol. Fine-tuned versions follow the
  base model.\ngpt-5-mini (shutdown) -> gpt-5.6-terra. Fine-tuned versions 
 follow the base model.\ngpt-5-nano (shutdown) -> gpt-5.6-luna. Fine-tuned 
 versions follow the base model.\ngpt-5-pro (shutdown) -> gpt-5.6-sol (reas
 oning.mode: pro). Fine-tuned versions follow the base model.\no3 (shutdown
 ) -> gpt-5.6-sol. Fine-tuned versions follow the base model.\no3-pro (shut
 down) -> gpt-5.6-sol (reasoning.mode: pro). Fine-tuned versions follow the
  base model.\nSources: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
