DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270102
SUMMARY:Google: 2 model changes
DESCRIPTION:gemini-3.6-flash (price). $0.75 / $3.75 per 1M input / output t
 okens becomes $1.50 / $7.50\; cached input $0.075 becomes $0.15.\ngemini-3
 .8-flash (price). $0.75 / $3.75 per 1M input / output tokens becomes $1.50
  / $7.50\; cached input $0.075 becomes $0.15.\nSources: https://aistudio.g
 oogle.com/docs/pricing
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
